### Test 1: Update Jobs Licenses
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/updateJobsLicenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2201,
  "jobsLicenses": 2,
  "jobsAppEnabled": true
}

### Test 2: Update Jobs Licenses - Reduce and sign out a device
POST {{baseUrl}}/User/updateJobsLicenses
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 2201,
  "jobsLicenses": 1,
  "devicesToDeactivate": [
    9001
  ]
}
